# A real inventory is NON-SECRET (.env, hosts.yml, group_vars/all/main.yml --
# see SECRETS.md): every secret lives on the box in /etc/catena/config.json.
# Still untracked, because a .env carries per-client zone/account values.
inventory/*
!inventory/README.md

# Galaxy collections: the tree runs on ansible-core alone, and an install of
# them left in a checkout is not part of it.
.collections/

# Local ansible state + python bytecode from the filter/lookup plugins.
.ansible/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The test tooling: uv-managed venv and pytest cache.
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
